        <mxCell id="oLPVPFHUQ2T455JdV-RN-10" value="Use Case-Math" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="gjx5_syKnFXWjm4SH8Xj-14" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5em; margin: 0px; font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes: Kubenet (basic) networking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5em; margin: 0px; font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5em; margin: 0px; font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 204, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Use Case&lt;/b&gt;: IP Address Conservation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-wrap: wrap;&quot;&gt;The kubenet networking option is the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(153, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;default configuration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-wrap: wrap;&quot;&gt;for AKS cluster creation. With kubenet:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(153, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Nodes receive an IP address from the Azure virtual network subnet&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(153, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Pods receive an IP address from a logically different address space&lt;/span&gt; than the nodes&#39; Azure virtual network subnet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(153, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;This approach greatly reduces the number of IP addresses you need to reserve in your network space &lt;/span&gt;for pods to use&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;Network address &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(153, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;translation (NAT)&lt;/span&gt; is then configured so that the pods can reach resources on the Azure virtual network..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;The source IP address of the traffic is translated to the node&#39;s primary IP address.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px; background-color: rgb(255, 179, 102);&quot;&gt;UDR route traffic back into the cluster (inside the cluster) (Limit of400) routes, 400 nodes)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;Only the nodes receive a routable IP address. The pods use NAT to communicate with other resources outside the AKS cluster. This approach reduces the number of IP addresses you need to reserve in your network space for pods to use&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(153, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;The managed identity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt; (either system-assigned or user-assigned) is used by the AKS cluster to authenticate and authorize network operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=23;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontColor=#000000;" parent="oLPVPFHUQ2T455JdV-RN-10" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1400" y="975" width="3580" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div class=&quot;heading-wrapper&quot; data-heading-level=&quot;h3&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; position: relative; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;limitations--considerations-for-kubenet&quot; class=&quot;heading-anchor&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-inline-start: -1.875rem; padding-inline-start: 1.875rem;&quot;&gt;Limitations &amp;amp; considerations for kubenet&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;An &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;additional hop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; is required in the design of kubenet, which adds minor &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;latency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; to pod communication.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Route tables and user-defined routes are required for using kubenet, which adds complexity to operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;For more information, see&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/egress-udr&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Customize cluster egress with a user-defined routing table in AKS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/egress-outboundtype&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Customize cluster egress with outbound types in AKS&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Direct pod addressing isn&#39;t supported for kubenet due to kubenet design.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Unlike Azure CNI clusters, multiple kubenet clusters can&#39;t share a subnet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;AKS doesn&#39;t apply Network Security Groups (NSGs) to its subnet and doesn&#39;t modify any of the NSGs associated with that subnet. If you provide your own subnet and add NSGs associated with that subnet, you must ensure the security rules in the NSGs allow traffic between the node and pod CIDR. For more details, see&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/concepts-network#network-security-groups&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Network security groups&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;not supported on kubenet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;include:&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/use-network-policies#create-an-aks-cluster-and-enable-network-policy&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Azure network policies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/windows-faq&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Windows node pools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/virtual-nodes#network-requirements&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;Virtual nodes add-on&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" link="&lt;div class=&quot;heading-wrapper&quot; data-heading-level=&quot;h3&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; position: relative; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;limitations--considerations-for-kubenet&quot; class=&quot;heading-anchor&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; font-size: clamp(1.3125rem, 15.4737px + 1.15132vw, 1.75rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-inline-start: -1.875rem; padding-inline-start: 1.875rem;&quot;&gt;Limitations &amp;amp; considerations for kubenet&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;An additional hop is required in the design of kubenet, which adds minor latency to pod communication.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Route tables and user-defined routes are required for using kubenet, which adds complexity to operations.&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle;&quot;&gt;For more information, see&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/egress-udr&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;Customize cluster egress with a user-defined routing table in AKS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/egress-outboundtype&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;Customize cluster egress with outbound types in AKS&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Direct pod addressing isn&#39;t supported for kubenet due to kubenet design.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Unlike Azure CNI clusters, multiple kubenet clusters can&#39;t share a subnet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;AKS doesn&#39;t apply Network Security Groups (NSGs) to its subnet and doesn&#39;t modify any of the NSGs associated with that subnet. If you provide your own subnet and add NSGs associated with that subnet, you must ensure the security rules in the NSGs allow traffic between the node and pod CIDR. For more details, see&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/concepts-network#network-security-groups&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;Network security groups&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Features&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;not supported on kubenet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;include:&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/use-network-policies#create-an-aks-cluster-and-enable-network-policy&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;Azure network policies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/windows-faq&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;Windows node pools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/virtual-nodes#network-requirements&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;Virtual nodes add-on&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" id="AmPbSOTsEj-LQQa_ocP6-44">
          <mxCell style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=28;" parent="oLPVPFHUQ2T455JdV-RN-10" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="-790" y="1610" width="850" height="530" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; position: relative; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot; data-heading-level=&quot;h2&quot; class=&quot;heading-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 32px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-inline-start: -1.875rem; padding-inline-start: 1.875rem;&quot; class=&quot;heading-anchor&quot; id=&quot;prerequisites&quot;&gt;Prerequisites&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;The virtual network for the AKS cluster must allow outbound internet connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Don&#39;t create more than one AKS cluster in the same subnet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;AKS clusters can&#39;t use&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 28px; direction: ltr; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;169.254.0.0/16&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 28px; direction: ltr; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;172.30.0.0/16&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 28px; direction: ltr; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;172.31.0.0/16&lt;/code&gt;, or&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 28px; direction: ltr; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;192.0.2.0/24&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for the Kubernetes service address range, pod address range, or cluster virtual network address range. The range can&#39;t be updated after you create your cluster.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;The cluster identity used by the AKS cluster must at least have the&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 28px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/role-based-access-control/built-in-roles#network-contributor&quot;&gt;Network Contributor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;role on the subnet within your virtual network.&lt;/span&gt; CLI helps set the role assignment automatically. If you&#39;re using an ARM template or other clients, you need to manually set the role assignment. You must also have the appropriate permissions, such as the subscription owner, to create a cluster identity and assign it permissions. If you want to define a&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-size: 28px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/role-based-access-control/custom-roles&quot;&gt;custom role&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;instead of using the built-in Network Contributor role, you need the following permissions:&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 28px; direction: ltr; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks/subnets/join/action&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle; font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 28px; direction: ltr; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks/subnets/read&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" link="&lt;div class=&quot;heading-wrapper&quot; data-heading-level=&quot;h2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; position: relative; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;prerequisites&quot; class=&quot;heading-anchor&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 32px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; font-size: clamp(1.59375rem, 18.7895px + 1.39803vw, 2.125rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-inline-start: -1.875rem; padding-inline-start: 1.875rem;&quot;&gt;Prerequisites&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, SegoeUI, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;The virtual network for the AKS cluster must allow outbound internet connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Don&#39;t create more than one AKS cluster in the same subnet.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;AKS clusters can&#39;t use&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; direction: ltr; background-color: var(--theme-inline-code); overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;169.254.0.0/16&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; direction: ltr; background-color: var(--theme-inline-code); overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;172.30.0.0/16&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; direction: ltr; background-color: var(--theme-inline-code); overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;172.31.0.0/16&lt;/code&gt;, or&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; direction: ltr; background-color: var(--theme-inline-code); overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;192.0.2.0/24&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for the Kubernetes service address range, pod address range, or cluster virtual network address range. The range can&#39;t be updated after you create your cluster.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;The cluster identity used by the AKS cluster must at least have the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/role-based-access-control/built-in-roles#network-contributor&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;Network Contributor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;role on the subnet within your virtual network. CLI helps set the role assignment automatically. If you&#39;re using an ARM template or other clients, you need to manually set the role assignment. You must also have the appropriate permissions, such as the subscription owner, to create a cluster identity and assign it permissions. If you want to define a&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/role-based-access-control/custom-roles&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;custom role&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;instead of using the built-in Network Contributor role, you need the following permissions:&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; direction: ltr; background-color: var(--theme-inline-code); overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks/subnets/join/action&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: circle;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; direction: ltr; background-color: var(--theme-inline-code); overflow-wrap: break-word; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.1em 0.2em;&quot;&gt;Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks/subnets/read&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" id="AmPbSOTsEj-LQQa_ocP6-45">
          <mxCell style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=28;labelBackgroundColor=default;" parent="oLPVPFHUQ2T455JdV-RN-10" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="200" y="1630" width="1020" height="670" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="YLipig3j6BaiT96UUwU8-9" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 41px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(128, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;Use Case:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;AKS Kubenet is ideal for scenarios where:&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;IP Address Conservation:&lt;/span&gt; You need to conserve IP addresses within your VNet, as Kubenet uses a smaller number of routable IP addresses.&lt;br&gt;Simple Networking Requirements: Your applications do not require direct communication with other Azure resources within the VNet.&lt;br&gt;Cost Efficiency: You prefer a simpler and potentially more cost-effective networking setup.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(128, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;Key Design Points:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Pod IP Assignment:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Pods are assigned IP addresses from a separate, non-routable IP address space&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Each node in the cluster gets a single IP address from the VNet subnet.&lt;br&gt;Network Address Translation (NAT):&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Pods communicate with resources outside the node using NAT&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;This allows multiple pods to share a single IP address from the VNet subnet.&lt;br&gt;Service CIDR and DNS:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Similar to Azure CNI, a separate CIDR block is defined for Kubernetes services.&lt;br&gt;A specific IP within the Service CIDR is reserved for the DNS service.&lt;br&gt;Scalability:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Suitable for clusters with a moderate number of nodes and pods.&lt;br&gt;Less suitable for very large clusters due to potential NAT performance limitations.&lt;br&gt;Network Policies:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supports Kubernetes network policies for controlling traffic between pods.&lt;br&gt;Provides basic network isolation and security.&lt;br&gt;Example Configuration:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 41px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 41px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(128, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Key Limits:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Maximum Nodes:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;The theoretical maximum number of nodes in an AKS cluster is 5,000.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;However, practical limits are often lower due to IP address constraints and other factors.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Maximum Pods per Node:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;The default maximum number of pods per node is 110.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;This can be adjusted using the --max-pods parameter during cluster creation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(22, 22, 22);&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;kubenet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;: Example: A simple&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit;&quot;&gt;/24&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;IP address subnet can support up to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit;&quot;&gt;251&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;nodes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; in the cluster. Each Azure virtual network subnet reserves the first three IP addresses for management operations. This node count can support up to&amp;nbsp; (251 x 110 =&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit;&quot;&gt;27,610&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;pods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;, with a default maximum of 110 pods per node.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 41px; box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(22, 22, 22);&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Azure CNI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;: That same basic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit;&quot;&gt;/24&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;subnet range (Total 251 available IP) you can only support a maximum of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit;&quot;&gt;eight&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;nodes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; in the cluster. This node count can only support up to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit;&quot;&gt;240 (8x30)&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;pods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;, with a default maximum of 30 pods per node. Nodes will use 8 IPs and Pods will use the 240 IPs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=40;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;html=1;" parent="oLPVPFHUQ2T455JdV-RN-10" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-3410" y="-790" width="2500" height="3350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="AmPbSOTsEj-LQQa_ocP6-46" value="&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Architects+Daughter&quot; face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;Azure Documentation LInks&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=35;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#0000CC;" parent="oLPVPFHUQ2T455JdV-RN-10" vertex="1">
