-color: rgb(255, 153, 51);&quot;&gt;NodePort:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;unset&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp; 31836/TCP&lt;br&gt;Endpoints:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 10.244.0.16:80,10.244.1.8:80,10.244.2.9:80&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Session Affinity:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;None&lt;br&gt;External Traffic Policy:&amp;nbsp; Cluster&lt;br&gt;Events:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;none&amp;gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=29;fontFamily=Courier New;html=1;" parent="WfwI8hsEHnIwHEpeUaaj-78" vertex="1">
