        <mxCell id="RmEEv3Yl5RT3NWJRKuHY-45" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;IPs&lt;/span&gt;: The internal cluster IP assigned to this Service is&amp;nbsp;10.101.14.196. This is the IP address within the cluster through which the Service can be accessed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;LoadBalancer Ingress&lt;/span&gt;: The external IP address assigned by the load balancer is&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(153, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;135.237.110.180&lt;/span&gt;. This is the IP address through which external traffic can reach the Service.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Ports&lt;/span&gt;: The Service listens on port&amp;nbsp;8080&amp;nbsp;over TCP and forwards traffic to&amp;nbsp;targetPort&amp;nbsp;80&amp;nbsp;on the selected pods. The&amp;nbsp;NodePort&amp;nbsp;assigned is&amp;nbsp;31836, which is the port on each node&#39;s IP through which this Service is accessible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Endpoints&lt;/span&gt;: The Service has endpoints&amp;nbsp;10.244.0.16:80,&amp;nbsp;10.244.1.8:80, and&amp;nbsp;10.244.2.9:80, indicating the IP addresses and ports of the pods that are currently selected by this Service&#39;s selector." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;textShadow=0;fontSize=36;fontFamily=Courier New;" parent="WfwI8hsEHnIwHEpeUaaj-78" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3040" y="40" width="1210" height="850" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;k describe service nginx-service-internal -n demo-ns&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Name:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;nginx-service-internal&lt;br&gt;Namespace:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; demo-ns&lt;br&gt;Labels:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;none&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;Annotations:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; service.beta.kubernetes.io/azure-load-balancer-internal: true&lt;br&gt;Selector:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;app=nginx&lt;br&gt;Type:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;LoadBalancer&lt;br&gt;IP Family Policy:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;SingleStack&lt;br&gt;IP Families:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; IPv4&lt;br&gt;IP:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;10.101.242.219&lt;br&gt;IPs:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 10.101.242.219&lt;br&gt;LoadBalancer Ingress:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;172.16.239.7&lt;br&gt;Port:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;unset&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp; 8080/TCP&lt;br&gt;TargetPort:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;80/TCP&lt;br&gt;NodePort:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;unset&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp; 32283/TCP&lt;br&gt;Endpoints:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 10.244.0.16:80,10.244.1.8:80,10.244.2.9:80&lt;br&gt;Session Affinity:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;None&lt;br&gt;External Traffic Policy:&amp;nbsp; Cluster&lt;br&gt;Events:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;none&amp;gt;" id="RmEEv3Yl5RT3NWJRKuHY-46">
