        <mxCell id="RmEEv3Yl5RT3NWJRKuHY-47" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;IPs:&lt;/span&gt; The internal cluster IP assigned to this Service is&amp;nbsp;10.101.242.219, which is the IP address within the cluster through which the Service can be accessed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;LoadBalancer Ingress:&lt;/span&gt; The internal IP address assigned by the load balancer is&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(153, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;172.16.239.7&lt;/span&gt;. This IP is used within the Azure virtual network to access the Service.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Ports:&lt;/span&gt; The Service listens on port&amp;nbsp;8080&amp;nbsp;over TCP and forwards traffic to&amp;nbsp;targetPort&amp;nbsp;80&amp;nbsp;on the selected pods. The&amp;nbsp;NodePort&amp;nbsp;assigned is&amp;nbsp;32283, which is the port on each node&#39;s IP through which this Service is accessible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Endpoints:&lt;/span&gt; The Service has endpoints&amp;nbsp;10.244.0.16:80,&amp;nbsp;10.244.1.8:80, and&amp;nbsp;10.244.2.9:80, indicating the IP addresses and ports of the pods currently selected by this Service&#39;s selector" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;textShadow=0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=38;labelBackgroundColor=none;html=1;" parent="WfwI8hsEHnIwHEpeUaaj-78" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3040" y="1010" width="1430" height="980" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
