        <mxCell id="YLipig3j6BaiT96UUwU8-22" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Pod Network&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Overlay Network&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=35;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#4D9900;fontStyle=1" parent="WfwI8hsEHnIwHEpeUaaj-82" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1540" y="490" width="300" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YLipig3j6BaiT96UUwU8-71" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Use Case:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;The Azure CNI Overlay plugin and network model in Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) is designed to address scalability and IP address management challenges in large-scale Kubernetes deployments. It is particularly useful in scenarios where the number of pods exceeds the available IP addresses in the Azure Virtual Network (VNet) subnet.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Key Features:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Scalability:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Supports a larger number of pods per node and overall cluster size.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Not constrained by the VNet IP address space, allowing for high-density workloads.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;IP Allocation:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Pods are assigned IP addresses from an overlay network, which is a separate address space from the VNet subnet.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;This helps in conserving the VNet IP address space for other Azure resources.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Network Traffic Routing:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Uses an overlay network to route traffic between pods and nodes.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Traffic between pods on different nodes is encapsulated and routed through the overlay network.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Integration:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 44px;&quot;&gt;Provides integration with Azure services and features, such as monitoring and identity management.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=40;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;html=1;" parent="WfwI8hsEHnIwHEpeUaaj-82" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5830" y="100" width="2240" height="1740" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
