        <mxCell id="WfwI8hsEHnIwHEpeUaaj-84" value="Scenario: Powered by Cilium CNI" parent="0" visible="0" />
        <UserObject label="&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Azure CNI Powered by Cilium combines the robust control plane of Azure CNI with the data plane of&amp;nbsp;Cilium&amp;nbsp;to provide high-performance networking and security.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;By making use of eBPF programs loaded into the Linux kernel and a more efficient API object structure, Azure CNI Powered by Cilium provides the following benefits:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Functionality equivalent to existing Azure CNI and Azure CNI Overlay plugins&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Improved Service routing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;More efficient network policy enforcement&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Better observability of cluster traffic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Support for larger clusters (more nodes, pods, and services)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; position: relative; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot; data-heading-level=&quot;h2&quot; class=&quot;heading-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 32px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-inline-start: -1.875rem; padding-inline-start: 1.875rem;&quot; class=&quot;heading-anchor&quot; id=&quot;ip-address-management-ipam-with-azure-cni-powered-by-cilium&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;IP Address Management (IPAM) with Azure CNI Powered by Cilium&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Azure CNI Powered by Cilium can be deployed using two different methods for assigning pod IPs:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Assign IP addresses from an overlay network (similar to Azure &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;CNI Overlay mode&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Assign IP addresses from a virtual network (similar to existing &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Azure CNI with Dynamic Pod IP Assignment&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;EYeT0OH7zNsi5eHgqlDA&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;If you aren&#39;t sure which option to select, read&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: var(--theme-hyperlink); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;relative-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/azure-cni-powered-by-cilium&quot;&gt;&quot;Choosing a network model to use&quot;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" id="8G45v4QA7ZbLvMoKy6Ll-53">
