        <UserObject label="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;cordens.yaml&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;apiVersion: v1&lt;br&gt;kind: ConfigMap&lt;br&gt;metadata:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; name: coredns-custom&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; namespace: kube-system&lt;br&gt;data:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; nnlab.server: |&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; nnlab.local:53 {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; log&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; errors&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; cache 30&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(102, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; forward . 10.10.1.4 &amp;nbsp;# this is my test/dev DNS server&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; }&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;kubectl exec -it dnsutils -- nslookup test.nnlab.local&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;#&lt;br&gt;#&lt;br&gt;#&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;kubectl apply -f coredns.yaml&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;#&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;# Watch logs&lt;br&gt;#&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;kubectl logs -l k8s-app=kube-dns -n kube-system -f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;#&lt;br&gt;INFO] 172.16.240.79:51703 - 51401 &quot;A IN test.nnlab.local. udp 34 false 512&quot; - - 0 6.002682421s&lt;br&gt;[ERROR] plugin/errors: 2 test.nnlab.local. A: read udp 172.16.240.53:44903-&amp;gt;10.10.1.4:53: i/o timeout&lt;br&gt;[WARNING] No files matching import glob pattern: custom/*.override&lt;br&gt;[INFO] 172.16.240.79:51703 - 51401 &quot;A IN test.nnlab.local. udp 34 false 512&quot; - - 0 4.002232536s&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;[ERROR] plugin/errors: 2 test.nnlab.local. A: read udp 172.16.240.53:41751-&amp;gt;10.10.1.4:53: i/o timeout&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;[WARNING] No files matching import glob pattern: custom/*.override&lt;br&gt;[WARNING] No files matching import glob pattern: custom/*.override&lt;br&gt;^C&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;k exec -it dnsutils sh&amp;nbsp; kubectl exec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;/ # nslookup store1.nnlab.local&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Server:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;10.101.0.10&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Address:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 10.101.0.10#53&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(102, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;Name:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;store1.nnlab.local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(102, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;Address: 172.27.225.10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[INFO] 172.16.240.67:54922 - 56591 &quot;A IN store1.nnlab.local. udp 36 false 512&quot; NOERROR - 0 6.000832415s&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[ERROR] plugin/errors: 2 store1.nnlab.local. A: read udp 172.16.240.68:55106-&amp;gt;1.2.3.4:53: i/o timeout&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[INFO] 172.16.240.67:54922 - 56591 &quot;A IN store1.nnlab.local. udp 36 false 512&quot; NOERROR - 0 4.000589636s&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[ERROR] plugin/errors: 2 store1.nnlab.local. A: read udp 172.16.240.68:46451-&amp;gt;1.2.