        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;nginx Ingress Controller&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102); font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;USe case:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Layer 7 (route based on Host headers and URL based routing and Multisite hosting on the same IP on the application Gateway, support HTTP/HTTPs traffic, SSL terminantion&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;Incluster ingress Controller vs AGIC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Path based and URL based routing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;AGIC (Application Gateway Ingress controller)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Architects Daughter&amp;quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;USe case:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Layer 7 (route based on Host headers and URL based routing and Multisite hosting on the same IP on the application Gateway, support HTTP/HTTPs traffic, SSL terminantion&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;Supported CNI: Azure CNI - Note below about Kubenet and CNI Overlay&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;AGIC add-on to expose your Kubernetes application in an existing AKS cluster through an existing application gateway deployed in&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AKS cluster in one virtual network and an application gateway in a separate virtual network to simulate existing resources.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;With Load Balancer - Layer 4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;Example:&amp;nbsp; HOST based:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;red.domainname.com, green.domainname.com, blue.domainname.com&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Example: Path Based: app.domainname.com/red, green and blue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Outbound Using Load balancer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" id="wds_56pwzj9tad6c899d-62">
          <mxCell style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSize=30;" parent="WfwI8hsEHnIwHEpeUaaj-86" vertex="1">
