        <mxCell id="BXbiH0vPpDBBbSI0rrvh-284" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;NOte: The&amp;nbsp;ClusterIP&amp;nbsp;services are still required for the Kubernetes DNS to resolve the service names to their respective ClusterIPs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;However, AGIC doesn&#39;t use these ClusterIPs for routing. Instead, it retrieves the pod IPs from the Kubernetes API&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;server and uses them to configure the Azure Application Gateway.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin: 16px 0px; text-wrap: wrap; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;How Traffic Routing Works:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 28px; text-wrap: wrap; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.3rem; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5em; margin: 0px; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;DNS Resolution&lt;/strong&gt;: When a request is made to&amp;nbsp;&lt;code style=&quot;border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 3px; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;aksred.penguintrails.com&lt;/code&gt;, the DNS resolves this to the public IP address of the Azure Application Gateway.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.3rem; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5em; margin: 0px; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;Application Gateway&lt;/strong&gt;: The Application Gateway receives the request and uses the rules defined in the Ingress resource to determine the backend pool to route the traffic to.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.3rem; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5em; margin: 0px; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;Backend Pool&lt;/strong&gt;: The backend pool contains the IP addresses of the pods that are part of the service. The Application Gateway routes the traffic to one of these pod IP addresses.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.3rem; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5em; margin: 0px; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;Pod Recreation&lt;/strong&gt;: When pods are recreated and get new IP addresses, the AGIC updates the backend pool with the new IP addresses.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSize=25;html=1;fontColor=#000000;" parent="AcSUpaBrBinRsQVvcUlR-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4310" y="2440" width="1940" height="460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wds_56pwzj9tad6c899d-46" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;Ingress: AGIC (Application Gateway Ingress Controller)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;Azure CNI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=35;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="AcSUpaBrBinRsQVvcUlR-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="620" y="-220" width="1030" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" link="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/azure-cni-overlay?tabs=kubectl#limitations-with-azure-cni-overlay" id="wds_56pwzj9tad6c899d-53">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="AcSUpaBrBinRsQVvcUlR-6" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="-1150" y="1980" width="1483.36" height="280" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="wds_56pwzj9tad6c899d-54" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2035px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BSPOKE%20VNET%26lt%3Bbr%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2035px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B172.16.0.0%2F16%26lt%3Bbr%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2035px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22text%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dcenter%3BverticalAlign%3Dmiddle%3Bresizable%3D0%3Bpoints%3D%5B%5D%3Bautosize%3D1%3BstrokeColor%3Dnone%3BfillColor%3Dnone%3BfontSize%3D35%3BfontFamily%3DArchitects%20Daughter%3BfontSource%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Ffonts.googleapis.com%252Fcss%253Ffamily%253DArchitects%252BDaughter%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%221415%22%20y%3D%22-50%22%20width%3D%22230%22%20height%3D%22140%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=35;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="AcSUpaBrBinRsQVvcUlR-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="345" y="1160" width="20" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wds_56pwzj9tad6c899d-55" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;AGIC (Application Gateway Ingress controller)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;USe case:&lt;/span&gt; Layer 7 (route based on Host headers and URL based routing and Multisite hosting on the same IP on the application Gateway, support HTTP/HTTPs traffic, SSL terminantion&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;Supported CNI: Azure CNI - Note below about Kubenet and CNI Overlay&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;AGIC add-on to expose your Kubernetes application in an existing AKS cluster through an existing application gateway deployed in&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AKS cluster in one virtual network and an application gateway can be in separate virtual network &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;as long as the networks are peered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;With Load Balancer - Layer 4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;Example:&amp;nbsp; HOST based:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;red.domainname.com, green.domainname.com, blue.domainname.com&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Example: Path Based: app.domainname.com/red, green and blue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Outbound Using Load balancer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=30;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;" parent="AcSUpaBrBinRsQVvcUlR-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-130" y="1110" width="1680" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wds_56pwzj9tad6c899d-56" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#0000ff&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;172.16.245.0/24&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0000ff&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;aks-app-gw-subnet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=35;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1" parent="AcSUpaBrBinRsQVvcUlR-6" vertex="1">
