        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Egress Options:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;Use case:&lt;/span&gt; BYO firewall or egress firewalling requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;DNS Proxy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Authorized IP Ranges&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Default outbound-type is LoadBalancer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Changing OutboundType on exisiting cluster is disruptive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;NAT Gateway: outbound-type ManagedNATGateway or UserAssignedNATGateway (BYO NAT GW)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;api-server-authorized-ip-ranges (AKS Nodes access to AKS control plane,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; developer API access - on-prem IP, azure VM as jumpbox IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;7. If not configured properly nodes will lose control plane access&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;8. OUtbound Rules:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: center;&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/outbound-rules-control-egress&quot;&gt;Outbound network and FQDN rules for Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) clusters - Azure Kubernetes Service | Microsoft Learn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;9. Assymetric routing issue with LB:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: center;&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/firewall/integrate-lb#public-load-balancer&quot;&gt;Integrate Azure Firewall with Azure Standard Load Balancer | Microsoft Learn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 35px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/egress-outboundtype#supported-migration-paths-for-managed-vnet" id="FXxEmtVGAynKrAXIJSTr-199">
